  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Talent Theft</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/69/Hero_Killer%27s_Avatar_of_Plundering_Hero_Killer.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241023022543\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Hero Killer&#39;s Avatar of Plundering Hero Killer\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/69/Hero_Killer%27s_Avatar_of_Plundering_Hero_Killer.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20241023022543\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/69/Hero_Killer%27s_Avatar_of_Plundering_Hero_Killer.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20241023022543 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/69/Hero_Killer%27s_Avatar_of_Plundering_Hero_Killer.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20241023022543 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Hero Killer&#39;s Avatar of Plundering Hero Killer\" width=\"121\" height=\"500\" data-image-key=\"Hero_Killer%27s_Avatar_of_Plundering_Hero_Killer.jpg\" data-image-name=\"Hero Killer&#39;s Avatar of Plundering Hero Killer.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Ihwa/Hero Killer's (Hero Killer) Gift, Avatar of Plundering allows her to steal and copy the skills of other Gift users.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Steal skill/talent.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><i>\"It is only human to dream of rising above one's limitations. But what if we had the power to instantly acquire the qualities that we envy in others? Would it bring real fulfillment... or a hunger that can never be filled?\"</i></dd>\n<dd>― Second Thoughts opening words (The Outer Limits)</dd></dl></div>\n<p>The ability to <b>steal the skill/talent from others</b>. Technique of <a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Manipulation\" title=\"Talent Manipulation\">Talent Manipulation</a>. Opposite of <a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Bestowal\" title=\"Talent Bestowal\">Talent Bestowal</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTalent_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Skill/Specialty Theft</li>\n<li>Talent/Skill/Specialty Absorption</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTalent_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can steal the physical and mental skills, talents and specialties of another person. In some cases, the user gains that skill or talents for themselves while in other cases they simply remove the talent from someone else.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTalent_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Imprinting\" title=\"Ability Imprinting\">Ability Imprinting</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Intuition\" title=\"Ability Intuition\">Ability Intuition</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Intuitive_Replication\" title=\"Intuitive Replication\">Intuitive Replication</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Adoptive_Muscle_Memory\" title=\"Adoptive Muscle Memory\">Adoptive Muscle Memory</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Skill_Erasure\" title=\"Skill Erasure\">Skill Erasure</a> - by stealing one's skills/talents</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTalent_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Supernatural_Arts_Theft\" title=\"Supernatural Arts Theft\">Supernatural Arts Theft</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTalent_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Power_Absorption\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Power Absorption\">Power Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Manipulation\" title=\"Talent Manipulation\">Talent Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Usurp_Worth\" title=\"Usurp Worth\">Usurp Worth</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTalent_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Anchoring\" title=\"Knowledge Anchoring\">Knowledge Anchoring</a></li>\n<li>May only be temporary.</li>\n<li>May only be able to take a specific type of talent.</li>\n<li>User may not have the physical, mental or emotional capabilities to put their stolen talents to use.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Bestowal\" title=\"Talent Bestowal\">Talent Bestowal</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Talent_Generation\" title=\"Talent Generation\">Talent Generation</a> can return or give new talents.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTalent_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Lord Shyamalan (<i>Channel Awesome</i>)</li>\n<li>Sarah (<i>Disney's So Weird: Rewind</i>)</li>\n<li>Puzzle Dopant (<i>Futo Detective</i>); via Arm</li>\n<li>Talent Suckers (<i>Hi Hi Puffy AmiYumi</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://herokiller.fandom.com/wiki/Ihwa\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:herokiller:Ihwa\">Ihwa, the Hero Killer</a> (<i>Hero Killer</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hunterxhunter.fandom.com/wiki/Chrollo_Lucilfer\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:hunterxhunter:Chrollo Lucilfer\">Chrollo Lucilfer</a> (<i>Hunter x Hunter</i>)</li>\n<li>The Morrigan (<i>Lost Girl</i>)</li>\n<li>Ann Marie LeBeau/Rogue (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Starlight Glimmer (<i>My Little Pony Series</i>)</li>\n<li>Meltlilith (<i>Nasuverse</i>)</li>\n<li>Baron Von Rocha (<i>Sofia the First</i>); only musical talents</li>\n<li>Nerdlucks/Monstars (<i>Space Jam</i>)</li>\n<li>Mrs. Pollywinkle (<i>The Grim Adventures of Billy and Mandy</i>)</li>\n<li>Bryan (<i>Thunderstruck</i>)</li>\n<li>Tinker Bell (<i>World of Winx</i>)</li>\n<li>Talent Thief (<i>World of Winx</i>)</li>\n<li>Victor (<i>Worm</i>)</li>\n<li>Taskmaster (<i>Marvel Comics</i>); only fighting styles</li>\n<li>All For One (<i>My Hero Academia</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://charlotte.fandom.com/wiki/Y%C5%AB_Otosaka\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:charlotte:Yū Otosaka\">Yū Otosaka</a> (<i>Charlotte</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://questism.fandom.com/wiki/Yun_Jo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:questism:Yun Jo\">Yun Jo</a> (<i>QUESTISM/PTJ Universe</i>); formerly</li>\n<li>Velvet and Veneer (<i>Trolls Band Together</i>); only musical talents</li>\n<li>The Chameleon (<i>Kung Fu Panda</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FTalent_Theft%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"8433ec4a1c6cd474e4f70b16e6954cdb\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:197px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:197px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Lord_Shyamalan-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:195px; width:192px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Lord_Shyamalan.png\" title=\"Lord Shyamalan.png (226 KB)\" style=\"height:195px; width:192px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/58/Lord_Shyamalan.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/192?cb=20170506034117\" title=\"Lord Shyamalan.png (226 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Lord Shyamalan (Channel Awesome) has mastered the art of &quot;Talentbending&quot;, the ability to suck the acting talents out of anybody using his thumb, leaving them as dull, wide-eyed and emotionless as characters in M. Night Shyamalan movies...\" height=\"195\" width=\"195\" data-image-name=\"Lord Shyamalan.png\" data-image-key=\"Lord_Shyamalan.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Lord Shyamalan (Channel Awesome) has mastered the art of &quot;Talentbending&quot;, the ability to suck the acting talents out of anybody using his thumb, leaving them as dull, wide-eyed and emotionless as characters in M. Night Shyamalan movies...\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Lord Shyamalan.png (226 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Lord Shyamalan (Channel Awesome) has mastered the art of &quot;Talentbending&quot;, the ability to suck the acting talents out of anybody using